@host = http://localhost:5214

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Cadastrar cliente (CPF válido de exemplo)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "email": "maria.silva@email.com"
}

### Obter cliente (troque o id)
@clienteId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clientes/{{clienteId}}
